    "instructions": "1. Muddle ginger in a shaker.\n2. Add the remaining ingredients, except for the Islay single malt whiskey.\n3. Fill the shaker with ice and shake.\n4. Double-strain into a chilled old fashioned glass with ice.\n5. Float the single malt whiskey on top.",
